Package: penguins-census
Version: 0.2.0-1
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Piero Proietti <piero.proietti@gmail.com>
Depends: ca-certificates, curl, gzip
Description: Privacy-respecting anonymous telemetry server for penguins-eggs
 penguins-census receives anonymous remaster and installation events from
 penguins-eggs, resolves only a 2-letter ISO country code in memory without
 storing client IP addresses, and exposes aggregated JSON statistics.
